{"_meta":{"aura.historia/access":"protected","aura.historia/operationId":"listNotifications","aura.historia/requiredScopes":["notifications:read"]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"List the signed-in user's notifications, such as watchlist changes and new saved-search matches, with each listing as it was when notified, in the requested language. Returns up to size notifications (default 21, 1 to 100); pass the returned searchAfter array as a JSON string to get the next page. Each result's `viewUrl` is the provider link meant to be shared with people: it carries Aura Historia's referral tagging, which is lost when its query parameters are changed. `url` is the provider's untagged address. Amounts are always integers in the currency's minor unit when one exists (EUR `119199` = \u20ac1,191.99; USD in cents). For currencies without minor units, such as JPY, the amount is whole units (`211453` = \u00a5211,453). Follow ISO 4217 exponents.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"language":{"default":"en","description":"Language of the returned notification text, as an ISO 639-1 code (default `en`).","enum":["de","en","fr","es","it","zh","pt","pl","tr","nl","cs","ja","ru","ar","ko","el","he","th","hi","de-DE","de-AT","de-CH","de-LU","de-LI","en-US","en-GB","en-AU","en-CA","en-NZ","en_IE","fr-FR","fr-CA","fr-BE","fr-CH","fr-LU","es-ES","es-MX","es-AR","es-CO","es-CL","es-PE","es-VE","it-IT","it-CH","zh-CN","zh-Hans","zh-TW","zh-Hant","zh-HK","pt-PT","pt-BR","pl-PL","tr-TR","nl-NL","nl-BE","cs-CZ","ja-JP","ru-RU","ar-SA","ar-EG","ar-AE","ko-KR","el-GR","he-IL","th-TH","hi-IN"],"type":"string"},"searchAfter":{"description":"Continuation from the previous page: its `searchAfter` array of [created time, notification ID] serialized as a JSON string, passed back exactly as returned.","type":["string","null"]},"size":{"de